Step 2 - Install Python

Check your Python version:

python --version

or

python3 --version

You should have Python 3.11 or newer.

Step 3 - Create a Virtual Environment

Windows:

python -m venv venv

Activate it:

venv\Scripts\activate

You should see:

(venv)

at the start of your terminal prompt.

Step 4 - Install Dependencies

Create a requirements.txt with:

fastapi
uvicorn
requests
pandas
numpy
pandas-ta
python-telegram-bot
python-dotenv
sqlalchemy
yfinance
schedule

Then install:

pip install -r requirements.txt
Step 5 - Create .env
TELEGRAM_TOKEN=
CHAT_ID=

GEMINI_API_KEY=

INITIAL_BALANCE=2000

We'll fill these values later.

Step 6 - Verify Setup

Create main.py:

print("TradeMind AI Started Successfully 🚀")

